# Evidence-bound answers

**Product law:** Coop's factual repository/integration claims must be supported by **admitted evidence for this turn**. When the requested fact or relation is missing, empty or unverified, state that limit briefly and omit unsupported sections. Preserve other useful supported findings when present; one missing evidence kind does not invalidate a different supported finding. Never pad or present a scoped hypothesis as an established fact.

This governs product answer content, not the length of an authorized engineering plan/audit or whether its agent should continue work. A truthful unknown can pass an expected-unknown case; unnecessary abstention fails a supported-positive task. Private validation failures do not authorize publishing the rejected draft.

## Applies to

Blast Radius, Understand Repo, Knowledge Gaps, Trace Decision, Find Owner, plain chat, L (local file) turns — **every code host** (GitHub, GitLab, Bitbucket).

## Required behavior

| Evidence state | Answer shape |
|----------------|--------------|
| Confirmed dependents / rich anchors / owners / docs | Cite them; be dense enough to act |
| Empty graph / unverified impact | State the impact limit briefly. Explain any actually admitted local behavior within its scope; do not invent dependents, inevitable impact or unrelated checklist sections |
| Narrow Understand anchors | Low/partial confidence. Do **not** overfit the product story to one route or file |
| L file only | Attached body only + honest-limit. No invented callers, serializers, NuGet, checklists |
| Empty integration / hunt | Honest miss. Do not invent tickets, decisions, or paths |

## Banned (Fail)

| Reject | Prefer |
|--------|--------|
| “Impact unverified” then a long impact essay | Short unverified + stop |
| Architecture syllabus from 1–2 thin anchors | Partial confidence + what anchors actually show |
| “Check every consumer / search the codebase” with no dependents attached | Honest limit: other files were not read |
| Filling every template section with one speculative line | Omit empty sections entirely |
| Wrong-project / local `AGENTS.md` as Use-repo gaps evidence | In-repo or attached-for-this-turn evidence only |

## Implementation choke

- Shared copy: `EVIDENCE_BOUND_ANSWERS_RULE` in `src/prompts/evidenceSynthesis.ts` (wired into `OPERATING_CONTEXT` and grounding).
- Finish gates must **replace** fluff on empty Blast / L hunt leads — not prepend a caveat and keep the essay.
- Density / “actionable” in `OPERATING_CONTEXT` applies only when evidence supports action.

## Self-check

Would empty Blast on GitLab still ship “unverified” plus a page of Direct impact from reading the target file? If yes, fail.
Would Understand with two webhook anchors claim the product is “mainly webhooks”? If yes, fail.
Would an L “what else should I check?” invent consumers not in the file? If yes, fail.
